| 2 | 成果物 ID `pm-plan`・`pm-communication-plan`・`pm-quality-management-plan`・`pm-organization`・`pm-roles`・`pm-members`・`pm-raci` | `docs/ja/specdojo/templates/dct-project-management-template.yaml` | 一致 | 同じ `local_id` がある |
